WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:44.955
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:45.225 --> 01:47.985
Next time, just come here to make photocopies.

3
01:48.585 --> 01:51.825
Life isn't easy for you. Don't waste money at the copy shop.

4
01:53.025 --> 01:53.865
Thank you, miss.

5
01:53.945 --> 01:55.145
However,

6
01:55.225 --> 01:58.185
you still have to join group activities

7
01:58.265 --> 01:59.905
like class meetings and lectures.

8
01:59.985 --> 02:03.585
Just skip what you can and don't be late if you can help it.

9
02:07.105 --> 02:08.144
Chen Yanzhou,

10
02:08.825 --> 02:10.065
what happened to you?

11
02:15.585 --> 02:16.425
I was careless.

12
02:17.665 --> 02:19.745
I came to ask about the elective PE class.

13
02:19.825 --> 02:22.585
The football teacher said he didn't receive my request,

14
02:22.665 --> 02:23.625
but I submitted it.

15
02:25.985 --> 02:29.105
After discussing it with the Academic Affairs Office,

16
02:29.185 --> 02:31.065
we think football isn't right for you.

17
02:31.665 --> 02:33.865
You had heart problems in the past.

18
02:33.945 --> 02:36.265
What if intense exercise causes you to have a relapse?

19
02:36.345 --> 02:38.785
I've submitted my physical exam results.

20
02:38.865 --> 02:40.225
I've already recovered.

21
02:41.025 --> 02:43.905
Our university has many other PE courses.

22
02:43.985 --> 02:46.705
Tai chi, yoga, and aerobics

23
02:46.785 --> 02:48.105
are all more moderate.

24
02:48.185 --> 02:49.945
I can approve any of those.

25
02:51.865 --> 02:52.945
Right, Zheng Yu.

26
02:53.025 --> 02:55.145
You chose the tai chi class, right?

27
02:55.225 --> 02:56.185
Isn't it easy?

28
02:58.705 --> 02:59.545
Rollerblading.

29
03:02.625 --> 03:03.985
I must've remembered wrong.

30
03:04.065 --> 03:06.145
Rollerblading isn't bad either.

31
03:06.225 --> 03:07.665
How is the class?

32
03:09.665 --> 03:11.825
Pretty good. The teacher is kind.

33
03:11.905 --> 03:13.025
Good class vibe too.

34
03:13.105 --> 03:15.105
A newbie could pick it up easily.

35
03:15.185 --> 03:16.865
How about rollerblading?

36
03:17.545 --> 03:20.105
Miss, I'll just be frank.

37
03:20.985 --> 03:23.065
I chose football because I'm good at it.

38
03:24.065 --> 03:25.825
As long as I'm not absent or tardy,

39
03:26.385 --> 03:27.625
and don't get a substitute,

40
03:27.705 --> 03:29.545
I'll have a guaranteed perfect score.

41
03:29.625 --> 03:31.905
Besides, my choice complies with the rules.

42
03:31.985 --> 03:34.185
I can't think of any reason I can't take it.

43
03:37.385 --> 03:38.905
You have to understand

44
03:38.985 --> 03:42.145
that we have to be prudent as teachers sometimes.

45
03:42.225 --> 03:45.585
Moreover, your family circumstances are rather unique.

46
03:51.505 --> 03:52.545
How about this?

47
03:53.585 --> 03:54.425
Let's compromise.

48
03:56.305 --> 03:57.465
Fill this out.

49
03:57.985 --> 03:59.665
Get your doctor to sign off on it.

50
03:59.745 --> 04:03.625
If the doctor confirms that you can handle the physical load,

51
04:03.705 --> 04:06.225
I will personally submit your application.

52
04:06.305 --> 04:07.505
But I…

53
04:14.625 --> 04:15.785
Thank you, miss.

54
04:21.624 --> 04:22.545
Zheng Yu,

55
04:23.225 --> 04:26.185
as it happens, I want to talk to you.

56
04:26.265 --> 04:29.665
Your academic performance in the past two years has been good.

57
04:29.745 --> 04:31.545
Do you have any plans

58
04:31.625 --> 04:34.865
to boost your learning outside the classroom?

59
04:35.705 --> 04:37.465
Our college has a professor

60
04:37.545 --> 04:41.345
who has a spot for an undergraduate in her lab this semester.

61
04:41.425 --> 04:44.745
The lab works on real projects through industry partnerships.

62
04:45.545 --> 04:47.745
As soon as I heard, I thought of you.

63
04:47.825 --> 04:51.305
If you can get in, it would be a great learning experience.

64
04:51.905 --> 04:55.185
If I get in, do I get to work on paid projects right away?

65
04:55.265 --> 04:57.305
Not so fast.

66
04:57.385 --> 05:01.505
You will have to at least get a doctorate first, or secure funding as a postdoc.

67
05:02.105 --> 05:05.305
There is plenty of time. Look ahead to the future.

68
05:06.065 --> 05:06.905
Miss,

69
05:07.745 --> 05:09.505
only those who have everything

70
05:09.585 --> 05:11.745
can look far ahead like that.

71
05:12.705 --> 05:13.945
For someone like me,

72
05:14.745 --> 05:15.985
what is in front of me

73
05:16.945 --> 05:17.945
is all I can see.

74
05:20.945 --> 05:23.145
What I mean by "look ahead to the future"

75
05:23.225 --> 05:25.265
is your overall plan.

76
05:25.345 --> 05:27.305
Who can succeed instantly?

77
05:27.945 --> 05:31.345
With your GPA, if you get into the lab,

78
05:31.425 --> 05:33.665
you're guaranteed to get the Vitality Award.

79
05:35.825 --> 05:37.705
-The Vitality Award? -Yes.

80
05:37.785 --> 05:40.025
Lab research will get you extra points

81
05:40.105 --> 05:41.985
when applying for the Vitality Award.

82
05:42.065 --> 05:43.865
It's a new regulation this semester.

83
05:43.945 --> 05:45.665
It counts more than a high GPA.

84
05:48.545 --> 05:49.625
Which professor's lab?

85
05:50.665 --> 05:52.585
Professor Cheng Xiulin.

86
05:52.665 --> 05:54.625
I'll get the document for you.

87
05:58.185 --> 06:00.105
Lab research will get you extra points

88
06:00.185 --> 06:02.145
when applying for the Vitality Award.

89
06:02.225 --> 06:03.905
It's a new regulation this semester.

90
06:03.985 --> 06:05.545
It counts more than a high GPA.

91
06:14.705 --> 06:17.345
Linjie, I want to ask you

92
06:17.425 --> 06:19.585
about Cheng Xiulin's lab.

93
06:19.665 --> 06:20.945
When is a good time?

94
06:21.025 --> 06:22.305
WANG LINJIE

95
06:26.105 --> 06:28.425
How about tomorrow? Come see me.

96
06:28.505 --> 06:29.985
PROFESSOR CHENG XIULIN

97
06:30.825 --> 06:33.345
Okay, that's pretty much it.

98
06:33.425 --> 06:36.265
If you have questions, you can ask me anytime.

99
06:36.345 --> 06:37.585
Thanks, Linjie.

100
06:41.425 --> 06:43.425
Ms. Cheng was just here.

101
06:43.505 --> 06:44.945
I was going to introduce you.

102
06:45.025 --> 06:47.425
Maybe she had to step out.

103
06:48.025 --> 06:49.505
It's okay. Thank you, Linjie.

104
06:49.585 --> 06:50.745
You're welcome.

105
06:51.465 --> 06:54.225
BULLETIN BOARD

106
06:56.785 --> 06:58.025
Professor Cheng.

107
07:00.665 --> 07:01.745
Have you recovered?

108
07:02.945 --> 07:04.345
I'm fine now.

109
07:05.145 --> 07:07.065
I'm sorry for the trouble.

110
07:07.145 --> 07:08.785
In all my years as a teacher,

111
07:08.865 --> 07:11.145
you're the first student of mine to collapse in the lab.

112
07:13.945 --> 07:16.665
I haven't had the chance to apologize to you in person.

113
07:17.705 --> 07:18.785
Chen Yanzhou,

114
07:19.385 --> 07:21.265
I'm not the one you should apologize to.

115
07:22.065 --> 07:23.345
It's yourself.

116
07:23.945 --> 07:24.945
And your parents.

117
07:25.625 --> 07:28.145
If something truly had happened that day…

118
07:28.225 --> 07:31.745
Do you intend to put them through that again?

119
07:33.665 --> 07:35.785
Do I still have a chance to come back?

120
07:39.625 --> 07:41.665
I will email the application.

121
07:42.225 --> 07:44.825
I hope you can view each resume fairly.

122
07:45.425 --> 07:47.545
I'm busy. I have to go.

123
08:12.545 --> 08:15.625
Looks like Cheng Xiulin didn't agree to let you return.

124
08:17.105 --> 08:19.185
UNDERGRADUATE RECRUITMENT NOTICE

125
08:20.305 --> 08:21.785
No, she didn't.

126
08:22.505 --> 08:25.985
So I'll have to compete for the sole undergraduate spot.

127
08:29.825 --> 08:31.785
You're more impressive than I thought.

128
08:31.865 --> 08:33.945
You spare no effort for the Vitality Award.

129
08:34.865 --> 08:36.625
You're no better.

130
08:36.705 --> 08:40.144
To boost your GPA, you won't even change your PE class,

131
08:40.225 --> 08:41.465
disregarding your health.

132
08:44.345 --> 08:47.185
We're not close enough to care about each other's health.

133
08:49.425 --> 08:52.465
Instead of trying to cozy up to me, why not compete properly?

134
08:53.545 --> 08:54.385
Fine.

135
09:02.105 --> 09:03.945
Don't you dare be late today.

136
09:04.025 --> 09:05.105
LU SIQUAN (STORE MANAGER)

137
09:12.145 --> 09:15.385
Do you know why indoor cats can never beat stray cats?

138
09:18.665 --> 09:21.425
Because indoor cats fight as play.

139
09:22.865 --> 09:24.625
Stray cats fight

140
09:25.305 --> 09:26.705
for survival.

141
09:34.065 --> 09:36.945
UNDERGRADUATE APPLICATION FOR CHENG XIULIN'S LABORATORY

142
09:41.825 --> 09:44.185
Zheng Yu, here's the latest news.

143
09:44.265 --> 09:47.105
Does your class have a new student named Chen Yanzhou?

144
09:47.185 --> 09:50.465
I heard he also applied for the spot in Ms. Cheng's lab.

145
09:50.545 --> 09:52.305
He's a strong competitor.

146
09:52.385 --> 09:53.545
WANG LINJIE

147
09:54.345 --> 09:55.425
You might not know.

148
09:55.505 --> 09:57.665
He used to do research with Ms. Cheng.

149
09:57.745 --> 10:01.025
He only withdrew due to medical reasons.

150
10:04.225 --> 10:05.545
I know.

151
10:05.625 --> 10:07.025
CERTIFICATE OF RECOVERY

152
10:07.105 --> 10:08.865
I really can't sign this.

153
10:08.945 --> 10:12.945
I have no way to confirm or supervise the intensity of this class.

154
10:13.025 --> 10:15.625
What if I sign this and something happens?

155
10:15.705 --> 10:17.065
I know I can do it.

156
10:17.865 --> 10:20.145
You're confident, but I'm not.

157
10:20.745 --> 10:21.745
How about this?

158
10:21.825 --> 10:24.905
I'll give you a medical exemption note to give to your teacher.

159
10:25.545 --> 10:27.705
An exemption only gives me a pass.

160
10:28.265 --> 10:29.145
I want the credit.

161
10:29.945 --> 10:32.625
Your university's PE courses aren't that important.

162
10:32.705 --> 10:34.465
You're so strange.

163
10:34.545 --> 10:37.385
So many students ask me for an exemption

164
10:37.465 --> 10:38.985
so they can slack off.

165
10:39.065 --> 10:41.705
You, on the contrary, want the trouble.

166
10:42.385 --> 10:45.705
That's all the more reason that I can't sign this.

167
10:52.305 --> 10:53.305
Hello?

168
10:53.385 --> 10:54.305
Hello.

169
10:54.385 --> 10:56.985
This is the Shang'an Road Police Station.

170
10:57.065 --> 10:58.865
Are you Mr. Chen Yanzhou?

171
11:03.065 --> 11:04.745
Look. Do you see that?

172
11:04.825 --> 11:07.625
This was when your wallet was stolen.

173
11:08.385 --> 11:10.865
If this thief hadn't committed another crime there,

174
11:10.945 --> 11:12.345
we wouldn't have found this.

175
11:17.385 --> 11:18.505
Do you know this girl?

176
11:21.665 --> 11:23.385
What about her?

177
11:23.465 --> 11:24.865
The thief said

178
11:24.945 --> 11:26.345
this girl followed him

179
11:26.425 --> 11:28.945
to the emergency staircase and got the wallet back.

180
11:32.185 --> 11:34.825
There happened to be no CCTV there.

181
11:34.905 --> 11:37.305
We didn't know if he was telling the truth,

182
11:37.385 --> 11:41.305
so we asked you to come mainly to check if that girl returned the wallet to you.

183
11:49.025 --> 11:50.545
ZY, ADD TO ADDRESS BOOK

184
11:53.585 --> 11:55.185
SEND FRIEND REQUEST

185
11:58.185 --> 12:00.625
I'M CYZ IN THE "LIFE SCIENCES CLASS 1" GROUP

186
12:01.265 --> 12:02.225
On campus?

187
12:02.305 --> 12:05.465
ZHENG YU

188
12:05.545 --> 12:08.345
FAST NEIGHBOR (THE QING YI UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY BRANCH)

189
12:29.185 --> 12:30.505
Six hours have passed.

190
12:30.585 --> 12:32.505
We now change the cell culture medium.

191
12:32.585 --> 12:33.545
Take out our cells…

192
12:38.305 --> 12:40.705
Did you install this wind chime?

193
12:42.665 --> 12:43.705
That's smart.

194
12:44.345 --> 12:45.465
What do you want?

195
12:47.665 --> 12:48.985
Why didn't you say

196
12:49.065 --> 12:52.105
you got the wallet back from the thief?

197
12:53.225 --> 12:54.705
You weren't wrong that day.

198
12:55.305 --> 12:56.985
Even if you hadn't made that post,

199
12:57.065 --> 12:59.025
I would still have asked you for money.

200
12:59.745 --> 13:03.465
If I were a kind, selfless, and good person seeking no reward,

201
13:03.545 --> 13:05.985
when he made his move in the elevator,

202
13:06.665 --> 13:08.345
I would have called him out on it.

203
13:09.425 --> 13:10.545
But I'm not.

204
13:11.545 --> 13:15.425
So what does it matter whether I said it or not?

205
13:16.905 --> 13:18.185
At least I would think--

206
13:18.265 --> 13:20.825
At least I would seem less detestable?

207
13:22.265 --> 13:23.865
I don't care what others think.

208
13:23.945 --> 13:25.865
I already got what I wanted.

209
13:32.625 --> 13:33.785
Also,

210
13:33.865 --> 13:35.425
we're not so close

211
13:35.505 --> 13:37.225
as to sit and chat.

212
13:37.305 --> 13:40.745
In your own words, instead of trying to cozy up to me…

213
13:43.025 --> 13:44.465
why not compete properly?

214
13:58.625 --> 14:00.185
Hello, Professor Cheng Xiulin.

215
14:01.305 --> 14:03.425
I'm Chen Yanzhou, a Life Sciences junior.

216
14:04.665 --> 14:07.905
I hope to have the chance to join your lab.

217
14:17.345 --> 14:20.505
SELLING PERFUME (MINOR FLAW) ON RQ SECONDHAND GOODS

218
14:36.185 --> 14:38.425
MOLECULAR MECHANISM BY WHICH THE CXN48 GENE…

219
14:45.545 --> 14:46.385
Zheng Yu,

220
14:46.985 --> 14:49.665
can you dim the light a bit?

221
14:49.745 --> 14:51.905
The brightness is keeping me awake.

222
15:13.985 --> 15:15.225
Did you send the email?

223
15:15.905 --> 15:17.145
Yes.

224
15:17.225 --> 15:18.425
What did Ms. Cheng say?

225
15:21.465 --> 15:23.905
Actually, don't pin all your hopes on that.

226
15:23.985 --> 15:27.025
You can try different things.

227
15:27.865 --> 15:29.905
You could try a different research topic.

228
15:37.705 --> 15:39.585
What about your choice of PE class?

229
15:40.505 --> 15:41.905
The university and the hospital

230
15:42.465 --> 15:43.705
won't let me take football.

231
15:44.585 --> 15:45.505
What did you pick then?

232
15:46.585 --> 15:49.985
This is a new addition to our class. Chen Yanzhou.

233
15:50.785 --> 15:52.825
By the way, which college are you in?

234
15:53.425 --> 15:54.545
Life Sciences.

235
15:55.665 --> 15:57.185
That's the same as Zheng Yu.

236
15:57.785 --> 15:59.305
Different majors, though.

237
16:00.145 --> 16:01.745
-Same class. -Okay.

238
16:01.825 --> 16:02.905
In that case,

239
16:02.985 --> 16:05.145
Zheng Yu, you can look after him.

240
16:05.225 --> 16:07.905
Everyone else, listen up.

241
16:08.505 --> 16:10.905
During practice, help each other out.

242
16:10.985 --> 16:12.825
Then you will improve faster. Got it?

243
16:12.905 --> 16:14.545
-Got it. -Got it.

244
16:15.705 --> 16:16.545
Wait.

245
16:17.225 --> 16:18.865
Where are your rollerblades?

246
16:22.305 --> 16:24.385
Borrow a pair from the equipment room!

247
16:24.465 --> 16:25.865
When you show up,

248
16:25.945 --> 16:29.025
either bring your own pair or borrow a pair in advance.

249
16:29.105 --> 16:31.665
Don't be unprepared again. Got it?

250
16:33.625 --> 16:36.025
The teacher is kind. Good class vibe too.

251
16:42.185 --> 16:44.825
I suggest you get a medical exemption.

252
16:45.385 --> 16:46.625
You can still get a pass.

253
16:47.665 --> 16:49.945
And you? So what if you can rollerblade?

254
16:50.545 --> 16:52.145
Has Cheng Xiulin replied to you?

255
16:53.025 --> 16:55.345
I heard you don't have any lab experience.

256
16:55.425 --> 16:57.785
Getting the spot will be hard.

257
17:03.425 --> 17:05.985
A newbie could pick it up easily.

258
17:06.065 --> 17:07.305
Why pick this class?

259
17:11.625 --> 17:12.825
I didn't pick it.

260
17:12.905 --> 17:14.065
Someone paid to swap.

261
17:17.184 --> 17:18.625
At your skill level,

262
17:18.704 --> 17:19.825
how can you teach me?

263
18:05.065 --> 18:06.425
I'll say this first.

264
18:07.025 --> 18:08.105
If you cut class,

265
18:08.785 --> 18:10.025
I won't cover for you.

266
18:11.625 --> 18:12.625
I just need the restroom.

267
18:30.985 --> 18:32.185
I should've known.

268
18:36.425 --> 18:39.265
CAMPUS LEARNING WEEK: ENCOUNTER A BETTER VERSION OF YOURSELF.

269
18:51.505 --> 18:53.025
You can definitely beat him.

270
18:54.945 --> 18:56.825
-What? -I was in the equipment room.

271
18:56.905 --> 18:58.745
Chen Yanzhou was borrowing rollerblades.

272
18:58.825 --> 19:00.185
He can't do it at all.

273
19:00.265 --> 19:01.945
You can definitely win.

274
19:03.425 --> 19:04.585
I don't care about winning.

275
19:14.025 --> 19:16.785
I never tell myself that I want to win.

276
19:16.865 --> 19:18.865
My only thought is that I must not lose.

277
19:20.705 --> 19:23.025
The desire to win stems from expectations.

278
19:23.105 --> 19:24.465
The desire not to lose

279
19:24.545 --> 19:26.105
is because there is no way out.

280
19:28.505 --> 19:29.865
With this mindset,

281
19:30.505 --> 19:32.585
I hurry across campus in the early morning.

282
19:52.625 --> 19:54.545
I'm not the only one in a hurry.

283
20:22.225 --> 20:23.665
It's scary.

284
20:23.745 --> 20:26.225
-What? -I was reading comics at the library.

285
20:26.305 --> 20:28.225
Zheng Yu and Chen Yanzhou

286
20:28.305 --> 20:30.825
studied there all afternoon and never got up.

287
20:33.025 --> 20:36.065
I heard they're competing to get into Ms. Cheng's lab.

288
20:36.145 --> 20:38.065
Zheng Yu is our roommate,

289
20:38.145 --> 20:41.225
but I think Cheng Xiulin will choose Chen Yanzhou.

290
20:41.305 --> 20:42.345
He was there first.

291
20:43.145 --> 20:44.665
Not necessarily.

292
20:46.025 --> 20:49.025
Maybe Zheng Yu will impress her more.

293
21:00.785 --> 21:03.665
Zheng Yu, your application form has been received.

294
21:04.385 --> 21:05.665
The written test, interview time,

295
21:05.745 --> 21:07.225
location, and notes

296
21:07.305 --> 21:08.825
have been sent to you.

297
21:08.905 --> 21:10.465
Please check your inbox.

298
21:14.265 --> 21:15.665
Chen Yanzhou,

299
21:15.745 --> 21:17.585
your application form has been received.

300
21:17.665 --> 21:20.985
The written test, interview time, location, and notes

301
21:21.065 --> 21:22.265
have been sent to you.

302
21:22.345 --> 21:23.985
Please check your inbox.

303
21:24.065 --> 21:25.705
Cheng Xiulin's laboratory.

304
21:47.145 --> 21:49.705
Today's written test doesn't seem too hard.

305
22:31.505 --> 22:33.145
Next, Zheng Yu.

306
22:41.625 --> 22:43.185
ZHENG YU, COLLEGE OF LIFE SCIENCES

307
22:43.265 --> 22:44.425
Zheng Yu.

308
22:46.225 --> 22:49.185
The resume you submitted left a deep impression.

309
22:49.265 --> 22:53.105
It seems you did a lot of research when writing your application.

310
22:53.705 --> 22:54.545
However,

311
22:54.625 --> 22:56.505
I'm not looking to recruit an undergraduate

312
22:56.585 --> 22:58.905
to do simple data organization,

313
22:59.585 --> 23:02.065
assist their upperclassmen,

314
23:02.145 --> 23:03.505
and be free labor.

315
23:03.585 --> 23:07.425
I hope that they can truly be involved in the project

316
23:08.025 --> 23:11.225
and find a role that suits them in the project.

317
23:12.185 --> 23:13.025
Of course.

318
23:13.825 --> 23:17.025
If it were only for the former, I wouldn't be here.

319
23:18.465 --> 23:22.105
I see you were recommended for admission after a biology competition.

320
23:23.185 --> 23:25.465
That shows you have great potential.

321
23:25.545 --> 23:27.145
And in the past two years,

322
23:27.225 --> 23:29.985
your grades in your major have been excellent.

323
23:30.985 --> 23:33.265
Honestly, I'm quite satisfied with you.

324
23:34.385 --> 23:37.945
However, you haven't applied to any labs before.

325
23:38.665 --> 23:40.465
What consideration lies behind this?

326
23:42.025 --> 23:43.745
I…

327
23:49.905 --> 23:50.985
I don't want to lie.

328
23:51.745 --> 23:54.545
Due to personal reasons, I need to make money.

329
23:55.185 --> 23:56.945
So for the past two years,

330
23:57.905 --> 23:59.425
I've been busy working.

331
24:00.945 --> 24:02.745
What are your plans for the future?

332
24:18.345 --> 24:19.945
Next, Chen Yanzhou.

333
24:22.465 --> 24:23.505
Originally,

334
24:23.585 --> 24:26.345
I wasn't inclined to approve your application.

335
24:26.425 --> 24:27.625
But you were right.

336
24:28.225 --> 24:30.225
I should judge fairly.

337
24:30.305 --> 24:32.305
Your grades and experience

338
24:32.385 --> 24:35.025
are sufficient to take you to this stage.

339
24:36.065 --> 24:39.385
I hope you can give me a chance to start over again.

340
24:58.985 --> 25:01.945
Do you know what truly starting over means?

341
26:10.265 --> 26:11.145
Buying something?

342
26:18.825 --> 26:19.665
Ring me up.

343
26:23.105 --> 26:24.505
That's 4,260 yuan.

344
26:35.625 --> 26:37.825
I'll pay the rest with WeChat Pay.

345
26:42.345 --> 26:43.265
Finished?

346
26:43.345 --> 26:44.185
Thank you.

347
26:44.265 --> 26:45.105
You're welcome.

348
26:48.345 --> 26:51.065
Whose beautiful daughter is this?

349
26:52.345 --> 26:54.865
Ms. Yang, sorry for troubling you during this time.

350
26:54.945 --> 26:56.345
Why are you being so polite?

351
26:57.305 --> 26:59.065
You seem to have lost weight again.

352
26:59.145 --> 27:01.705
Have you been eating and resting properly?

353
27:02.865 --> 27:04.025
You clearly haven't.

354
27:04.105 --> 27:08.425
Say, you finally paid off the hospital charges.

355
27:08.505 --> 27:10.825
Then you come here, and you're on your laptop.

356
27:12.345 --> 27:13.465
Xiaozheng,

357
27:13.545 --> 27:16.225
sometimes, you need to catch your breath.

358
27:17.505 --> 27:19.185
All the part-time gigs

359
27:19.265 --> 27:22.225
were originally enough to pay for hospitalization costs.

360
27:22.305 --> 27:28.105
But now, I don't know when a costly emergency might come up.

361
27:28.745 --> 27:31.865
And on top of that, at the end of each semester, I have to…

362
27:33.105 --> 27:34.505
You have to what?

363
27:36.945 --> 27:38.225
Nothing.

364
27:38.305 --> 27:41.785
I'm just wondering if I can get the Vitality Award this semester.

365
27:43.305 --> 27:46.225
You said before that only your college offers it.

366
27:46.305 --> 27:47.145
Right?

367
27:48.665 --> 27:50.345
I'm wondering,

368
27:50.425 --> 27:52.425
how come only your college has it?

369
27:53.025 --> 27:58.105
The city's top scholar six years ago could have gone to a better institution.

370
27:58.185 --> 28:01.105
But he chose to go to Qing Yi University's College of Life Sciences

371
28:01.185 --> 28:02.305
to study thale cress.

372
28:02.385 --> 28:04.105
Thale what?

373
28:05.985 --> 28:08.545
It's a weed that grows by the roadside.

374
28:09.145 --> 28:10.865
How is a weed worth researching?

375
28:11.625 --> 28:14.425
Geniuses always know their calling early on.

376
28:15.025 --> 28:18.385
Some companies wanted to sponsor him and set up a fund

377
28:18.465 --> 28:20.505
to encourage people like him.

378
28:21.225 --> 28:23.305
It's what is now the Vitality Award.

379
28:23.385 --> 28:24.465
I remember.

380
28:24.545 --> 28:26.625
You previously said

381
28:26.705 --> 28:28.865
that this award was the reason

382
28:29.625 --> 28:30.865
you didn't change majors.

383
28:32.265 --> 28:33.105
It pays a lot.

384
28:33.705 --> 28:36.545
Then this top scholar

385
28:36.625 --> 28:38.865
is a guide in your academic journey.

386
28:39.985 --> 28:41.865
What is he doing now?

387
28:41.945 --> 28:43.265
He's so incredible.

388
28:43.345 --> 28:45.305
By now, he must have a PhD.

389
28:45.385 --> 28:46.225
A teacher?

390
28:46.305 --> 28:48.865
Maybe he even became his own boss.

391
28:49.705 --> 28:50.545
I don't know.

392
28:51.185 --> 28:53.425
I don't even have enough time for myself,

393
28:53.505 --> 28:55.545
much less to wonder about other people.

394
28:56.905 --> 28:58.305
Don't say that.

395
28:58.385 --> 29:00.785
Regardless of what job you do in the future,

396
29:01.825 --> 29:04.545
nothing bad can come from knowing more.

397
29:05.785 --> 29:06.905
Maybe

398
29:06.985 --> 29:08.705
it can give you more options.

399
29:31.665 --> 29:33.905
WHO IS ZHOU GUANQI, QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR?

400
29:33.985 --> 29:36.825
ZHOU GUANQI WINS NATIONAL BIOLOGY COMPETITION

401
29:41.105 --> 29:46.985
Does anyone know what Qingyi's top scholar six years ago, Zhou Guanqi, is doing now?

402
29:48.065 --> 29:50.665
POST

403
29:53.985 --> 29:57.625
DOES ANYONE KNOW WHAT QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR SIX YEARS AGO, ZHOU GUANQI, IS DOING NOW?

404
30:19.065 --> 30:19.985
We're closing.

405
30:21.065 --> 30:22.985
Are you going to eat those noodles?

406
30:28.945 --> 30:29.785
No.

407
30:33.145 --> 30:34.025
I'll take them home.

408
30:40.825 --> 30:42.345
What a weirdo.

409
30:49.145 --> 30:51.825
Xiaozheng, are you not returning to your dorm tonight?

410
30:52.705 --> 30:53.825
I'll sleep here today.

411
30:54.705 --> 30:56.065
Don't sleep hunched over.

412
30:56.145 --> 30:57.825
It's bad for your spine.

413
30:57.905 --> 30:58.745
Use this.

414
30:59.385 --> 31:00.985
It's getting colder now.

415
31:01.665 --> 31:04.945
There is a blanket in the bag next to my mom's bed.

416
31:05.025 --> 31:06.665
Don't mind it. It's clean.

417
31:06.745 --> 31:08.505
I just washed it a few days ago.

418
31:09.185 --> 31:10.345
Thank you.

419
31:11.025 --> 31:12.265
I'm leaving.

420
31:12.945 --> 31:15.825
When the caregiver isn't here, please look after her.

421
31:15.905 --> 31:17.145
Thank you.

422
31:42.905 --> 31:44.385
Hello, Zheng Yu.

423
31:44.465 --> 31:46.625
Thank you for your trust

424
31:46.705 --> 31:50.025
and the effort you put into the written test and interview,

425
31:50.105 --> 31:53.865
but we have found a suitable candidate for the undergraduate position.

426
31:53.945 --> 31:57.345
You're welcome to visit the laboratory and learn.

427
32:57.745 --> 32:59.425
Others rise to the rooster's crow.

428
32:59.505 --> 33:02.105
You probably get up earlier than the rooster.

429
33:03.025 --> 33:04.465
The early bird gets the worm.

430
33:06.665 --> 33:07.505
Got it.

431
33:07.585 --> 33:10.625
You got the worm, and now you're showing off. Congratulations.

432
33:15.185 --> 33:17.825
Didn't you receive an email from the lab?

433
33:17.905 --> 33:18.745
I did.

434
33:18.825 --> 33:20.625
Then why are you congratulating me?

435
33:20.705 --> 33:21.705
I didn't get in.

436
33:25.665 --> 33:26.625
What a coincidence.

437
33:27.225 --> 33:28.065
I didn't either.

438
33:40.065 --> 33:42.265
Human emotions are as fickle as the weather.

439
33:43.305 --> 33:46.025
I thought only successful people share their joy.

440
33:48.905 --> 33:50.665
Turns out two failures

441
33:50.745 --> 33:52.825
don't need to say a word

442
33:52.905 --> 33:55.265
to feel an inexplicable closeness.

443
34:03.185 --> 34:06.745
Ms. Cheng choosing Zhang Rui is understandable.

444
34:06.825 --> 34:08.065
You don't know, do you?

445
34:08.145 --> 34:10.625
Zhang Rui has been guaranteed admission into our graduate program

446
34:10.705 --> 34:12.985
and will keep working in the lab as a graduate student.

447
34:13.065 --> 34:14.784
It meets the hiring standards.

448
34:14.865 --> 34:15.705
So

449
34:16.264 --> 34:17.625
don't let it get to you.

450
34:20.185 --> 34:21.304
Are you listening?

451
34:23.105 --> 34:24.264
I understand.

452
34:24.344 --> 34:27.185
No matter who got in, it doesn't affect me.

453
34:27.264 --> 34:28.784
Besides,

454
34:28.865 --> 34:30.625
I'm not the only one who failed.

455
34:30.705 --> 34:33.545
If I were too fragile to take it, wouldn't I seem useless?

456
34:39.744 --> 34:40.585
What?

457
34:40.665 --> 34:42.905
I thought you would be depressed for a while.

458
34:44.344 --> 34:45.705
I don't have time for that.

459
34:46.585 --> 34:49.784
You've been on your phone since you got here. What is it?

460
34:49.865 --> 34:52.344
My advisor wants to talk about the Sports Meet.

461
34:53.824 --> 34:55.425
You were banned from PE classes.

462
34:55.505 --> 34:57.585
What can you do with the Sports Meet?

463
34:58.425 --> 35:00.945
I don't have enough community service credits.

464
35:01.025 --> 35:03.305
She wants me to volunteer at the Sports Meet.

465
35:03.385 --> 35:04.545
Then go.

466
35:05.745 --> 35:07.825
I was going to wait until the winter break

467
35:07.905 --> 35:10.265
and do volunteer work in the community with my mom.

468
35:10.345 --> 35:12.665
She gives environmental science talks.

469
35:12.745 --> 35:15.345
Getting proof of volunteer service would be easy.

470
35:16.785 --> 35:19.865
I think getting it done early at the university would be better.

471
35:20.905 --> 35:22.865
Your advisor has it tough.

472
35:22.945 --> 35:26.185
Juniors and seniors hardly ever participate at the meet.

473
35:26.265 --> 35:28.905
We get it. Seniors have one foot out the door.

474
35:28.985 --> 35:31.425
But many junior classes have zero participation.

475
35:31.505 --> 35:34.225
The numbers look terrible when they're reported.

476
35:34.305 --> 35:37.225
I heard the college wants to boost participation

477
35:37.305 --> 35:38.985
and even set up monetary prizes.

478
35:39.585 --> 35:41.745
The prize for a gold medal is only 500 yuan.

479
35:41.825 --> 35:43.385
I don't think it will help.

480
35:43.465 --> 35:45.425
THE 26TH SPORTS MEET REGISTRATION

481
35:47.345 --> 35:50.145
It's just the Sports Meet. All categories are full.

482
35:50.905 --> 35:52.705
Sign up for something unpopular.

483
35:52.785 --> 35:55.985
Fewer competitors means a higher chance of winning a medal.

484
35:56.705 --> 35:57.545
You don't say.

485
35:57.625 --> 36:00.745
They told me to sign up for a long-distance race.

486
36:00.825 --> 36:02.865
Class 1 has signed up, but not our class.

487
36:02.945 --> 36:04.785
Who is so brave in Class 1?

488
36:04.865 --> 36:06.705
No idea. Let me see.

489
36:06.785 --> 36:08.385
800 M, 1500 M, 3000 M, 100 M

490
36:10.465 --> 36:11.705
ZHENG YU

491
36:11.785 --> 36:12.985
Zheng Yu.

492
36:13.705 --> 36:15.105
Zheng Yu?

493
36:15.185 --> 36:17.305
I thought she wouldn't participate.

494
36:17.385 --> 36:20.065
This… This personal shopper can't be trusted.

495
36:20.985 --> 36:23.145
This size 37 feels like a size 36.

496
36:34.825 --> 36:36.385
Major discovery!

497
36:36.465 --> 36:38.345
Participant information is shown here.

498
36:39.505 --> 36:40.545
Her birthday is soon.

499
36:41.225 --> 36:42.065
When is it?

500
36:43.865 --> 36:45.945
My goodness, Zhuang Ning. So you were here.

501
36:47.825 --> 36:48.905
So when is it?

502
36:49.985 --> 36:51.625
-Friday. -Friday?

503
36:52.345 --> 36:54.065
That's the day of the Sports Meet.

504
36:59.985 --> 37:03.105
1500 M: ZHENG YU, 3000 M: ZHENG YU

505
37:05.345 --> 37:07.345
Dear teachers and students,

506
37:07.425 --> 37:08.945
for this crisp autumn season,

507
37:09.025 --> 37:13.465
we welcome Qing Yi University's 26th Track and Field Sports Meet.

508
37:14.065 --> 37:16.865
Let's welcome every participant's outstanding performance

509
37:16.945 --> 37:19.865
with great enthusiasm and high spirits.

510
37:20.705 --> 37:21.625
Thanks.

511
37:44.385 --> 37:45.865
Sir. Some water.

512
37:45.945 --> 37:46.785
Thank you.

513
37:57.065 --> 37:58.785
Wait!

514
37:59.825 --> 38:01.025
Wait!

515
38:02.665 --> 38:04.945
Chen Yanzhou from Class 1, right?

516
38:05.025 --> 38:06.465
Can I have a bottle of water?

517
38:07.665 --> 38:09.105
These are for the referees.

518
38:09.185 --> 38:10.625
There's a vending machine over there.

519
38:15.705 --> 38:16.625
Drink up.

520
38:17.425 --> 38:20.145
Linlin, you're still the best.

521
38:23.425 --> 38:26.345
Do you think Zheng Yu has returned to the dorm yet?

522
38:44.065 --> 38:45.625
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, ZHENG YU!

523
38:49.825 --> 38:52.905
Sorry for taking up your desk before.

524
38:52.985 --> 38:56.665
We can go to class together from now on. I'll save you a seat.

525
38:56.745 --> 38:58.785
Happy birthday, Zheng Yu!

526
39:22.345 --> 39:24.705
Why am I wasting time here?

527
39:26.465 --> 39:28.465
No way! You're volunteering too!

528
39:29.065 --> 39:30.305
You are…?

529
39:30.385 --> 39:33.265
Class 1's class monitor, Zhang Qi. We're in the same class.

530
39:36.945 --> 39:38.225
Yan… Yanzhou,

531
39:38.305 --> 39:39.785
I have to ask you for a favor.

532
39:40.785 --> 39:42.625
Look, I just got the news.

533
39:42.705 --> 39:46.065
This afternoon's shot put event was suddenly moved to tomorrow.

534
39:46.145 --> 39:47.025
Wrong person.

535
39:47.105 --> 39:48.905
I didn't sign up, and I can't do it.

536
39:48.985 --> 39:51.185
No, that's not it. I signed up.

537
39:51.265 --> 39:54.785
But the timing of the event clashes with my volunteer slot tomorrow.

538
39:54.865 --> 39:58.505
So I want to ask if you're free tomorrow.

539
39:58.585 --> 39:59.985
Can you volunteer for me?

540
40:00.065 --> 40:01.665
It won't take more than an hour.

541
40:01.745 --> 40:03.385
I'll come as soon as I'm done.

542
40:03.465 --> 40:06.105
I'm not free. I don't plan to come to campus tomorrow.

543
40:08.385 --> 40:09.385
Please help me out.

544
40:09.465 --> 40:12.665
If I could find anyone else, I wouldn't trouble you.

545
40:12.745 --> 40:15.225
Our class's participants have scheduling conflicts.

546
40:15.305 --> 40:17.545
For example, Liu Chen is shot-putting with me.

547
40:17.625 --> 40:19.105
Xing Mingtao will shoot hoops.

548
40:19.185 --> 40:21.665
Zheng Yu has the 3000 m race. I really…

549
40:22.265 --> 40:23.265
Zheng Yu

550
40:23.345 --> 40:24.745
is running the 3000 m?

551
40:27.545 --> 40:30.225
What event did you want me to volunteer for?

552
40:30.305 --> 40:31.665
The 3000 m race.

553
40:33.105 --> 40:35.105
Zhang Qi, what were you asking me?

554
40:35.185 --> 40:36.305
What?

555
40:39.065 --> 40:42.345
Are you free tomorrow to volunteer for me?

556
40:42.945 --> 40:44.105
Sure.

557
40:50.425 --> 40:52.585
You didn't see the hurdler.

558
40:52.665 --> 40:54.145
Every hurdle fell over.

559
40:54.225 --> 40:55.625
Be careful.

560
40:55.705 --> 40:56.785
What if we ruin it?

561
40:56.865 --> 40:58.585
How will you give it to Zheng Yu?

562
40:58.665 --> 41:00.745
If I ruin it, I'll buy ten for her.

563
41:03.225 --> 41:04.585
-Hide it. -Hide it.

564
41:04.665 --> 41:05.665
Come on.

565
41:05.745 --> 41:07.025
-Let's go. -Let's go.

566
41:10.705 --> 41:11.545
Let's go.

567
41:13.345 --> 41:14.465
Quietly.

568
41:31.585 --> 41:32.625
Still eating cake?

569
41:32.705 --> 41:33.825
Yes.

570
41:33.905 --> 41:35.785
I bought it. Why wouldn't we eat it?

571
41:43.185 --> 41:44.465
It's fine. Sit.

572
41:45.065 --> 41:47.665
Who says we can eat cake only for a birthday?

573
41:47.745 --> 41:49.705
We can eat it even without a birthday.

574
41:54.305 --> 41:55.225
Let's share it.

575
42:28.945 --> 42:31.065
Are you running the 3000 m in those shoes?

576
42:35.785 --> 42:36.745
Why not?

577
42:39.025 --> 42:41.025
You will be behind at the starting line.

578
42:42.625 --> 42:43.865
Thanks for the warning.

579
42:43.945 --> 42:47.825
As it happens, I've never stood at the same starting line anyway.

580
42:56.425 --> 42:58.145
Next, we have

581
42:58.225 --> 43:00.905
the women's 3000 m race, junior year group.

582
43:00.985 --> 43:04.105
The juniors only have one group, eight people in total.

583
43:04.185 --> 43:07.985
After the race starts, volunteers will help count your laps.

584
43:08.065 --> 43:09.625
The finish line is over there.

585
43:10.185 --> 43:11.105
Later,

586
43:11.185 --> 43:12.865
I will wait for you there.

587
43:16.225 --> 43:17.545
JUNIOR WOMEN'S 3000 M LAP COUNT

588
43:19.425 --> 43:20.945
No. 331 crossed the line.

589
43:21.505 --> 43:23.385
Okay, make sure not to cross the line.

590
43:27.585 --> 43:28.825
On your marks.

591
43:35.425 --> 43:36.585
-Go! -Go!

592
43:36.665 --> 43:38.105
We can now see

593
43:38.185 --> 43:41.105
the junior women's 3000 m race has officially begun.

594
43:41.185 --> 43:42.625
Currently in the lead

595
43:42.705 --> 43:44.065
is No. 331, Tong Ruyi,

596
43:44.145 --> 43:47.145
from the College of Management.

597
43:47.225 --> 43:48.065
-Go! -Go!

598
43:48.985 --> 43:50.105
-Go! -Go!

599
43:50.185 --> 43:51.865
First time volunteering at a meet?

600
43:52.385 --> 43:53.585
Relax.

601
43:53.665 --> 43:55.665
The outcome is obvious at a glance.

602
43:56.425 --> 43:57.545
Why?

603
43:57.625 --> 44:00.665
No. 323, Li Zheng, was on the track team as a freshman.

604
44:00.745 --> 44:02.985
Her movement and form are pro-level.

605
44:03.065 --> 44:04.345
She's pacing herself.

606
44:04.425 --> 44:05.505
She will surely win.

607
44:07.985 --> 44:09.785
Aren't athletes ranked separately?

608
44:09.865 --> 44:11.545
She left the team last year.

609
44:11.625 --> 44:13.945
She's good, but not considered a sports major.

610
44:17.625 --> 44:19.385
-Go! -Go!

611
44:19.465 --> 44:21.945
-Go! -Go!

612
44:22.025 --> 44:23.705
-Go! -Go!

613
44:23.785 --> 44:24.825
In the second lap,

614
44:24.905 --> 44:27.905
the eight contestants have separated into three groups.

615
44:27.985 --> 44:29.225
We can see

616
44:29.305 --> 44:32.825
the first group is No. 331 and No. 372.

617
44:33.545 --> 44:37.465
The second group has No. 323 and No. 308.

618
44:37.545 --> 44:40.665
Lagging behind in the third group are No. 357,

619
44:40.745 --> 44:42.025
No. 339,

620
44:42.105 --> 44:43.225
No. 351,

621
