47:47.905 --> 47:49.985
-Is she okay? -Right. Is something wrong?

669
47:55.905 --> 47:57.585
I'm here, Chen Yanzhou!

670
47:57.665 --> 47:58.505
Thanks so much!

671
47:59.105 --> 48:01.185
Still three runners left. Mark their laps.

672
48:54.425 --> 48:55.825
Why are you standing here?

673
48:55.905 --> 48:59.065
Sad that you failed the test, so you're standing in the rain?

674
49:00.025 --> 49:01.905
No, I'm just looking.

675
49:03.225 --> 49:04.145
Looking at what?

676
49:05.065 --> 49:06.865
Looking for anyone like me,

677
49:06.945 --> 49:08.105
unsure of where to go.

678
49:11.385 --> 49:12.585
Have you found anyone?

679
49:15.985 --> 49:16.945
Yes.

680
49:21.545 --> 49:22.585
How strange.

681
49:23.385 --> 49:24.945
We both lost.

682
49:25.505 --> 49:28.665
But I feel less lonely than when I win.

683
49:29.985 --> 49:31.145
It's not love.

684
49:31.225 --> 49:32.785
Nor is it friendship.

685
49:33.425 --> 49:34.945
It's not even understanding.

686
49:36.185 --> 49:37.865
It's just a confirmation of sorts.

687
49:38.585 --> 49:40.545
Confirmation that someone else

688
49:40.625 --> 49:42.105
is just like you,

689
49:42.985 --> 49:44.025
caught in the rain.
